OL,3,AFirefighters spend second night at
OL,4,Ascene of Glasgow scrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent a second night
OL,7,Fat the scene of a major blaze at a
OL,8,Fscrapyard in Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said the alarm was raised at the
OL,12,Fbusiness on South Street, in the
OL,13,FScotstoun area of the city, at about
OL,14,F23:23 on Friday.
OL,16,FOne local resident captured dramatic
OL,17,Ffootage of the fire at its peak, with
OL,18,Fexplosive bangs emitting from an area
OL,19,Fengulfed in flames.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
